error: 
  --> operator-without-parentheses.wipple:1:1
  |
1 | show 1 + 2
  | ^^^^^^^^^^
  | |
  | Missing parentheses around the inputs to `+`. (Spaces group before operators do, so you need to put parentheses around just the inputs to `+`.)
  | `show 1 + 2` adds `show 1` and `2` together, returning a `_`. This requires `Add` `()` `Number` `_`.
  | `show` displays `1` on the screen.

